Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.68,0:00:20.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.63,0:00:22.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wanna have a little fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.59,0:00:23.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.72,0:00:24.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell me your name and I'll tell you mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.61,0:00:26.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.72,0:00:28.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.02,0:00:30.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oops. I farted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.02,0:00:32.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you would hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.73,0:00:33.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, that popping noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.98,0:00:36.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh. I'm making popcorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.07,0:00:38.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm getting ready to watch a video.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.19,0:00:40.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ooh. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.28,0:00:41.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's just a scary movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.91,0:00:43.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Do you like scary movies?   - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.91,0:00:44.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's your favorite?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.58,0:00:46.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mm, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:48.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Think.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.29,0:00:50.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know. Um, Kazaam,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.91,0:00:52.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,the one where Shaq plays a genie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.65,0:00:54.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's not a horror movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.88,0:00:56.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, you haven't seen Shaq act.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:00:59.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, you have a nice voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.26,0:01:01.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.38,0:01:03.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You never did tell me your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.84,0:01:05.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why do you wanna know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.01,0:01:07.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Cause I wanna know who I'm looking at.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.56,0:01:12.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What... What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.10,0:01:14.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Nice breasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.44,0:01:16.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.90,0:01:18.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I wanna see what your insides look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.73,0:01:21.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well... Well, then, turn to page 54.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:25.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.83,0:01:29.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen, asshole, you've had your fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.12,0:01:31.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,now you better stop or else.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.12,0:01:32.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Or else what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.04,0:01:34.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Or else my boyfriend's gonna be here any minute,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.79,0:01:37.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and he's black and he'll kick your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.38,0:01:37.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.17,0:01:38.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.79,0:01:40.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You mean the one who wears makeup and dresses like a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.34,0:01:42.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.63,0:01:44.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Turn the porch lights on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.97,0:01:54.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.31,0:01:55.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's not my boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.98,0:01:57.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, I've fucked him a couple of times, but that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.73,0:02:01.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm calling the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.73,0:02:03.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go ahead. Call the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.19,0:02:06.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But you might wanna check the back door first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.95,0:02:08.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You forgot to lock it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.97,0:02:33.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Take that, you psycho!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.98,0:02:39.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't feel my legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.77,0:02:42.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I think my arm is broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.44,0:02:43.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.86,0:02:45.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I want my mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.70,0:02:50.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello, Drew.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.87,0:02:57.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.75,0:03:08.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.77,0:03:19.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.11,0:04:11.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.86,0:04:12.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.70,0:04:16.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.80,0:04:18.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.47,0:04:20.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Daddy, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.71,0:04:25.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Did you hear something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.58,0:04:27.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't hear anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.82,0:04:57.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Bobby, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.41,0:04:58.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My dad's in the other room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.87,0:04:59.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It just occurred to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.43,0:05:01.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I never climbed through your window before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.94,0:05:03.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now that you got it out of your system,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.45,0:05:05.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Bobby, you have to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.29,0:05:06.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.33,0:05:08.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Shh. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.83,0:05:11.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's going on in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.25,0:05:12.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ow! Daddy's head is stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.59,0:05:13.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Unstick Daddy's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.13,0:05:17.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Dad, can you knock?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.55,0:05:18.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Knock?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.34,0:05:19.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought I heard screaming in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.76,0:05:21.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No. No, you didn't, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.60,0:05:24.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, it could've been that crack I smoked earlier, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.60,0:05:25.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's what it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.23,0:05:28.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen, I gotta leave town for a couple of days. O.K?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.02,0:05:29.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.65,0:05:32.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just that new business I started with those Colombian guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.19,0:05:33.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean Uncle Escobar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.40,0:05:34.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.44,0:05:35.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, there's a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.90,0:05:37.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Some money went missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.36,0:05:39.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And apparently, some legs are gonna get broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.20,0:05:41.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's just better if I lay low for a couple of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.49,0:05:42.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If the cops raid the place...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.37,0:05:43.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I never heard of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.24,0:05:44.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And don't forget...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.24,0:05:46.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,To flush your stash.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.04,0:05:48.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, you are my little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.58,0:05:49.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I love you so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.92,0:05:51.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,that I left you a little something in the coffee can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.13,0:05:55.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Dad...   - But you have to remember to step on it before you sell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.17,0:05:56.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, what are you gonna cut it with?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.38,0:05:58.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Um, baking...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.38,0:06:00.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Baking soda. Not baking powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.34,0:06:01.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Because baking powder
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.51,0:06:03.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,guys will have muffins growing out of their nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.55,0:06:05.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You love that joke, don't you, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.56,0:06:07.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You've loved that joke since you were two years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.27,0:06:10.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.44,0:06:10.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:11.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.48,0:06:13.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Have a good trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.15,0:06:15.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Bye.   - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.15,0:06:18.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Is the coast clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.78,0:06:21.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, Cindy, that nightgown.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.20,0:06:24.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That was close. God!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.74,0:06:31.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I was, uh, home watching The Exorcist,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.54,0:06:32.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and it got me thinking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.87,0:06:34.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If this is about the time I puked green slime
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.04,0:06:36.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and masturbated with a crucifix...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.92,0:06:38.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It was my first keg party, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.21,0:06:41.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.13,0:06:42.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Uh, it was edited for TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.22,0:06:43.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All the good stuff was cut out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.09,0:06:46.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So you thought you would just climb through my window...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.77,0:06:48.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and we would play bump-bump?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.47,0:06:51.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I was kind of hoping to get my balls licked,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.31,0:06:53.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,but I wouldn't wanna break your little underwear rule,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.04,0:06:53.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,now, would I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.56,0:06:57.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So maybe just some on-top-of-the-clothes type stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.73,0:07:03.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. But just for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.72,0:07:19.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.80,0:07:22.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wrong set.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.14,0:07:27.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.76,0:07:29.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.44,0:07:35.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, Bobby, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.15,0:07:39.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.36,0:07:42.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.32,0:07:47.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, stud, you have to go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.99,0:07:55.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, um, about the sex stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.58,0:07:56.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I was only half serious. I don't wanna rush you or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.21,0:07:59.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, would you settle for PG-13?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.29,0:08:01.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.30,0:08:05.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.63,0:08:07.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Good night, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.68,0:08:16.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Shorty, you are so loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.02,0:08:19.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And make sure you take your behind to class today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.60,0:08:20.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I do be going to class.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.98,0:08:22.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lunch is not a class, Shorty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.98,0:08:24.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It is when you got the munchies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.23,0:08:27.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,See, that's why you such a dumb-ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.49,0:08:28.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.53,0:08:33.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You my brother. That's your mother too, jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.13,0:08:34.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.42,0:08:36.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, then, your father's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.91,0:08:38.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So? I don't know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.58,0:08:40.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.17,0:08:43.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, girl, you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.96,0:08:44.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.17,0:08:49.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We're gonna be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.26,0:08:50.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait. There's Buffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.01,0:08:53.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know why you hang out with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.22,0:08:55.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She is such a ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.06,0:08:56.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why do you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.18,0:08:58.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Cause I've seen her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.56,0:09:01.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My friend Sean had a pool party this summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.02,0:09:01.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.98,0:09:02.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, Puff Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.48,0:09:06.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Anyway, everybody was drinking Cristal champagne.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.69,0:09:07.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And then it started to get wild,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.98,0:09:09.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and people were getting freaky in the pool and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.40,0:09:14.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I look over and there was your girl getting buck wild in theJacuzzi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.91,0:09:15.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.37,0:09:18.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,With a backup dancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.25,0:09:20.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, that's nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.08,0:09:22.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's, That's lower than the security guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.83,0:09:25.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,At least security can get you backstage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.92,0:09:27.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She don't love herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.42,0:09:28.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.05,0:09:30.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I think Buffy's sweet, Brenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.59,0:09:33.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She is as fake as Press-on nails.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.93,0:09:35.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, baby girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.26,0:09:39.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What is up, my sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.14,0:09:41.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Bye, Mr. Gilmore.   - Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.27,0:09:44.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Is he gone?   - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.71,0:09:53.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Cindy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.24,0:09:59.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I love this color.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.16,0:10:00.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.45,0:10:05.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, you guys should not use this brand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.46,0:10:06.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.33,0:10:08.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Because they test their products on animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.57,0:10:08.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.29,0:10:13.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, have you seen what they do to those poor animals?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.93,0:10:19.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I am much more of a people person.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.72,0:10:22.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd like to feed all the hungry, little children of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.10,0:10:25.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd much rather help my fellow man than some animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.27,0:10:26.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Spare a dollar?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.81,0:10:28.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get away from me, you bum!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.44,0:10:30.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Buffy! Can't you see he's just hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.40,0:10:33.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Here you go, sir. A nice sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.57,0:10:35.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.19,0:10:37.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I said a dollar, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.99,0:10:43.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,God. Look at this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.95,0:10:45.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a circus.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.08,0:10:47.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello. I'm Gail Hailstorm,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.00,0:10:50.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,author of the book, You're Dead, I'm Rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.25,0:10:53.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,A small college town is in shock...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.38,0:10:55.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,after the unthinkable has happened:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.51,0:10:58.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,A brutal killing spree that left one teen dead...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.63,0:10:59.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.55,0:11:00.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Two teens dead...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.43,0:11:03.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And this small town shaken and stirred.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.85,0:11:05.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's times like these...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.35,0:11:06.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Police are combing the area for clues.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.93,0:11:09.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There are no witnesses available at this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.52,0:11:10.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There are no suspects in custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.10,0:11:13.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Police are asking anyone to come forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.23,0:11:14.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Reporting live for Black TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.32,0:11:16.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,White folks are dead and we're getting the fuck out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.40,0:11:19.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Grab your shit and let's go, motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.43,0:11:26.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you think the press is gonna wanna talk to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.83,0:11:27.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, girl, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.84,0:11:30.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The press only wants to interview the most ignorant person they can find.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.62,0:11:32.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm on TV!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.88,0:11:35.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit! First Cops, now this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.59,0:11:37.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I'm gonna be a star, son!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.05,0:11:39.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What can you tell us about Drew?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.34,0:11:41.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, she had the phat ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.93,0:11:43.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, it was like bang!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.51,0:11:45.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,How close were you to the victim?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.18,0:11:45.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Real close.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.45,0:11:47.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Until the roofies wore off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.80,0:11:49.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Then she woke up talking about pressing charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.89,0:11:51.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So I just pulled my tongue out of her ass and left.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.48,0:11:54.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What would have been your last words to Drew?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.94,0:11:57.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Run, bitch! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.78,0:12:03.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, yo, dawg. Does this shirt make me look gay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.45,0:12:05.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.04,0:12:08.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What about now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.62,0:12:12.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Nah.   - Cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.40,0:12:12.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.10,0:12:13.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Here. Take one, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.87,0:12:15.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't forget: Election's Tuesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.46,0:12:16.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't forget: Election's Tuesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.46,0:12:21.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ah! Goddamn it! Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.84,0:12:23.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.93,0:12:26.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My report card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.26,0:12:31.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, at least you got one "A."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.10,0:12:34.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I did, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.10,0:12:37.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're so smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.77,0:12:40.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, has anybody seen Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.82,0:12:42.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.49,0:12:43.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You know what? That kid is always late.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.90,0:12:46.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't get it. He lives so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.54,0:12:59.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,See you later, Hairy Mama, Bubba, Jim,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.75,0:13:01.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,BigJim, LittleJim, Slim Jim, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.26,0:13:03.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll see you later. Ciao, Ding. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.64,0:13:12.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Damn, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.10,0:13:15.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd sure like to get in them pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.89,0:13:16.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.89,0:13:18.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. What size are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.02,0:13:21.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.23,0:13:25.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey, Bobby.   - Hey, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.74,0:13:26.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- How you doing?   - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.45,0:13:28.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You guys see all the reporters out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.43,0:13:29.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.82,0:13:31.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Saying that girl Drew Decker got killed last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.70,0:13:33.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You know what? I think I knew her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.12,0:13:34.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.87,0:13:36.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She had a brother named Steve?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.87,0:13:37.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.75,0:13:40.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Long hair, pretty little mouth, perfect ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.83,0:13:41.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That was her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.88,0:13:43.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Nah, I was talking about Steve.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.00,0:13:45.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Whatever happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.46,0:13:47.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you guys think it's strange that she got killed...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.81,0:13:50.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,exactly one year after we,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.54,0:13:53.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,you know, killed that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.47,0:13:56.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Cindy, that was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.85,0:13:58.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Was it, Greg?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.79,0:14:17.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Would you look at what they're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.41,0:14:19.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,When are we gonna do stuff like that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.08,0:14:22.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,One day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.96,0:14:26.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- You like that, baby?   - Yeah, that's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.21,0:14:27.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- You like that?   - Oh, I love that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.38,0:14:30.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, I love when you play with my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.13,0:14:32.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not playing with your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.20,0:14:36.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.60,0:14:37.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.60,0:14:39.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.82,0:14:42.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bobby, put on some music.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.31,0:14:44.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.86,0:14:45.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Here. Put this on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.01,0:14:52.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's the shit right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.28,0:14:57.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.59,0:14:58.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.50,0:15:01.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.64,0:15:03.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, it's classic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.97,0:15:05.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Put on the radio, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.13,0:15:28.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- What! It was laundry day.   - What the fuck is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.24,0:15:38.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey. Come over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.33,0:15:41.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.16,0:15:42.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just get a little closer to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.95,0:15:44.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Something you're gonna tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.54,0:15:48.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Bobby, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.13,0:15:50.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I just want you to touch it. Just touch it. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.38,0:15:52.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just a little bit. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.97,0:16:01.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, that's what I'm talkin' about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.48,0:16:12.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.12,0:16:15.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Cindy...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.11,0:16:18.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.24,0:16:30.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.71,0:16:32.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.38,0:16:33.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I think we hit something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.76,0:16:40.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.89,0:16:45.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Bobby, look at my car, man! My dad's gonna freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.85,0:16:48.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I didn't see it. It came out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.73,0:16:50.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God, we hit a boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.65,0:16:51.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's the foot?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.85,0:16:52.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.90,0:16:54.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where the...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.44,0:16:59.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a body!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.32,0:17:00.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit, is he alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.74,0:17:01.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.57,0:17:03.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Well, check it out.   - I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.49,0:17:06.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Shit!   - We have to call the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.49,0:17:07.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No way. I ain't going to jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.87,0:17:08.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.79,0:17:11.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Cindy, do you know what they do to young boys in prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.04,0:17:15.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And all those sex-starved convicts just waiting for a fresh piece of meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.29,0:17:18.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're right, Cindy. Maybe we should call the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.63,0:17:19.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, That's a great idea, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.98,0:17:20.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But what about Brenda, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.01,0:17:22.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You think she wants to go to jail?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.43,0:17:23.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This is manslaughter, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.57,0:17:24.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We're all gonna fry for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.83,0:17:26.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We're looking at 10 to 15 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.79,0:17:27.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Shut up, Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.43,0:17:31.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's okay. I'm fine.   - We're in so much trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.64,0:17:32.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.69,0:17:34.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't blamethat shit on me, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.77,0:17:36.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, we'll get rid of the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.90,0:17:38.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.07,0:17:39.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.74,0:17:41.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- We'll dump him in the ocean.   - Not the ocean, the pier.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.11,0:17:43.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll be leaving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.24,0:17:44.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.20,0:17:45.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- What about the alcohol?   - We'll get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.16,0:17:47.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. It'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.20,0:17:48.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Hurry up. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.99,0:17:50.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Put him in the trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.54,0:17:52.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I won't have anything to do with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.62,0:17:53.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.42,0:17:56.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Cindy, come on. We'lljust pretend it never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.79,0:17:58.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, like the time we got drunk
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.06,0:17:59.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and we went down on each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.59,0:18:01.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll get his arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.42,0:18:02.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- l'll grab his other arm.   - l'll grab his his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.05,0:18:06.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll take him down to Williamson Cove and we'll dump him in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.64,0:18:07.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The sharks'll take care of the evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.31,0:18:11.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God, someone's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.56,0:18:13.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit. It's Shorty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.48,0:18:14.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Brenda, take care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.61,0:18:23.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Shorty, I know you ain't driving without no papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.32,0:18:26.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I got papers, blunts, bongs,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.82,0:18:29.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,all the ingredients to make a high nigga pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.20,0:18:33.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, yo, can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.20,0:18:34.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yo, what's up, Ray?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.25,0:18:36.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yo, son, you all need jumper cables?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.33,0:18:38.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Nah, we're cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.38,0:18:40.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, good, 'cause I left my roach clip at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.34,0:18:43.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go home, Shorty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.80,0:18:45.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I-I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.30,0:18:46.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Peace, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.47,0:18:48.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get the trunk closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.80,0:18:49.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It won't close.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.60,0:18:50.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.37,0:19:17.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold on. Hold on. Put him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.94,0:19:19.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He's heavy. Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.38,0:19:25.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, look. On three we dump him over the ledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.84,0:19:28.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait. Shouldn't we at least check his wallet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.47,0:19:29.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.82,0:19:31.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Shit, he might have some money.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.60,0:19:34.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We already committed murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.03,0:19:35.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We might as well rob his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.39,0:19:35.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll take the credit cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.35,0:19:37.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I want his jewelry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.43,0:19:38.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take his drawers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.68,0:19:42.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get off! Hey, yo, get off! His drawers are mine! Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.02,0:19:47.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- I got me a gold ring.   - Credit cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.23,0:19:49.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, let's get him in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.37,0:19:50.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't think I can, Greg.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.95,0:19:51.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.03,0:19:53.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Shut up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.53,0:19:55.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Christ, already. I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.37,0:19:57.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just get him in the water. O.K?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.54,0:20:00.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,One, two,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.54,0:20:00.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,three.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.17,0:20:08.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Right now we make a pact.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.69,0:20:10.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We take this to our grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.17,0:20:11.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Agreed?   - Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.75,0:20:13.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Agreed?   - Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.26,0:20:15.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Say it, Cindy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.39,0:20:17.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.23,0:20:19.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We take this to our grave. Say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.12,0:20:22.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We take this to our grave. Say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.68,0:20:23.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Greg, chill. Come on. You're hurting her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.69,0:20:24.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We take this to our grave. Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.73,0:20:29.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And we never mention this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.90,0:20:32.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mention what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.82,0:20:34.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The guy we just killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.24,0:20:37.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, you just mentioned it, Greg.
