Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.12,0:31:23.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You fucking bastards! Why won't anyone help?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.79,0:31:25.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Amazing.   - She's the next Pamela Lee.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.54,0:31:29.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, God! Oh, God! Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.01,0:31:31.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Greg, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.80,0:31:35.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Give it up for Buffy Gilmore! Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.10,0:31:38.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Absolutely fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.44,0:31:45.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I think we have a winner, ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.06,0:31:46.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Miss Buffy Gilmore!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.65,0:31:48.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Buffy, wait. You have to go back onstage.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.73,0:31:50.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No. I have to get to Greg.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.69,0:31:51.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But you won!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.57,0:31:52.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They're calling your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.57,0:31:53.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There's a killer...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.24,0:31:55.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I won?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.03,0:31:57.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They're calling your name. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.20,0:31:58.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Buffy, what happened? What about Greg?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.57,0:31:59.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, fuck Greg. I won.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.70,0:32:02.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Congratulations!   - Oh, out of my way, loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.57,0:32:06.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Miss Buffy Gilmore!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.52,0:32:13.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Give me my crown, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.53,0:32:34.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There's no sign of him anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.36,0:32:35.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He could've taken the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.32,0:32:37.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's impossible, Cindy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.23,0:32:39.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There's no blood. There's nothing. Look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.57,0:32:40.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I bet it's just Greg playing...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.54,0:32:42.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,another one of his dumb jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.35,0:32:43.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He's gonna turn up. I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.94,0:32:46.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He's probably at my house waiting for us right now,you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.68,0:32:47.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.97,0:32:49.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But you know what? I'm gonna look around some more, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.04,0:32:52.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You mind catching a ride home with Buffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.14,0:32:53.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.31,0:32:55.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- All right, fine.   - Call me later.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.36,0:33:18.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.40,0:33:19.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello, Cindy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.66,0:33:21.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.12,0:33:23.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's me, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.58,0:33:24.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, your boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.54,0:33:29.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm sorry. I guess I'm a little jumpy lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.92,0:33:31.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, any sign of Greg?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.67,0:33:32.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.29,0:33:34.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to come by?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.00,0:33:35.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.84,0:33:40.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm just gonna take a bath, and then I'm gonna go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.34,0:33:42.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. I'd really like to see you,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.39,0:33:43.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,but... I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.64,0:33:47.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Aw. I love you too, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.41,0:34:11.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Bobby, I told you...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.87,0:34:13.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I still know what you did last Halloween.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.54,0:34:15.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.25,0:34:36.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.69,0:34:37.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.65,0:34:39.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna slice you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.44,0:34:40.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.86,0:34:42.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna chop you like liver.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.44,0:34:43.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.90,0:34:44.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.57,0:34:48.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you know where I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.20,0:34:54.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I could be anywhere. I'm like the wind, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.63,0:34:57.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.76,0:35:03.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Um, you're-you're behind the couch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.51,0:35:06.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What? How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.14,0:35:08.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I can, um, see your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.10,0:35:14.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ah! Okay, turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.77,0:35:16.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Close your eyes. No peeking.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.61,0:35:25.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. No. No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.82,0:35:26.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, no peeking. No peeking. Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.53,0:35:29.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.03,0:35:31.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, now you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.45,0:35:35.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now do you know where I am? You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.08,0:35:39.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, Mr. Killer. I don't know where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.29,0:35:41.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a big clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.13,0:35:47.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh! I gotta stop drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.93,0:35:55.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Grandma!   - Ow, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.98,0:35:57.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my hip!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.47,0:36:32.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,White woman in trouble off the 744...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.14,0:36:39.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.52,0:36:42.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I heard screaming. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.98,0:36:43.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Bobby, he was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.48,0:36:46.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The killer was here, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.94,0:36:47.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.20,0:36:56.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I can explain that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.37,0:36:57.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.04,0:37:00.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Afriend gave 'em to me. Cindy. Cindy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.45,0:37:01.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Cindy. Cindy!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.54,0:37:04.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Cindy! Cindy! Cindy!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.05,0:37:12.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's me, Cind.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.05,0:37:16.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Cindy, you know me. Cindy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.39,0:37:24.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I know you've had a rough night, Cindy,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.70,0:37:25.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,so I won't keep you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.81,0:37:27.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I just want you to look at some photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.66,0:37:27.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.16,0:37:39.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.12,0:37:41.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.25,0:37:43.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.33,0:37:45.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.25,0:37:47.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, you're free to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.85,0:37:48.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you have somebody picking you up?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.38,0:37:51.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yeah.   - Oh. Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.80,0:37:53.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just check that one out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.05,0:37:57.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mm, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.93,0:38:00.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No? No? Well, worth a shot. All right, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.60,0:38:03.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Guess what I just did with those hookers we busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.31,0:38:04.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.39,0:38:06.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All the way, man! Yes, yes. Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.90,0:38:08.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Doofy!   - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.12,0:38:10.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Come on. Come on.   - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.23,0:38:13.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Special officer Doofy reporting.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.61,0:38:15.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Doofy, smell my fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.91,0:38:18.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.28,0:38:21.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's when you know you've become a man, Doofy!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.74,0:38:24.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Terry, smell my finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.08,0:38:27.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- What the hell is that?   - My ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.71,0:38:28.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get the hell out of here, Doofy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.13,0:38:31.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Doofy. Mom said get home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.09,0:38:34.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell Mom I'm on official police business.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.59,0:38:35.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Cindy, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.46,0:38:37.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey. No talking to the witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.55,0:38:40.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go get in the car, Doofy. She's coming with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.64,0:38:41.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Does Mom know?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.64,0:38:42.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Doofus.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.68,0:38:44.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mom says when I wear this badge,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.43,0:38:46.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,you're supposed to treat me like a man of the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.64,0:38:49.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mom also said for you to stop sticking your dick in the vacuum cleaner.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.44,0:38:55.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, three, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.03,0:38:57.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. Gosh darn.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.40,0:38:57.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.99,0:38:58.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's just that there's all these numbers with deci...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.86,0:38:59.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What, can't you count?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.11,0:39:00.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, I can count, but there's really...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.76,0:39:02.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me make it easy for you. Listen up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.95,0:39:04.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This little piggy went to the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.96,0:39:06.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This little piggy stayed home.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.75,0:39:08.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, if this little piggy doesn't roll the goddamn camera...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.50,0:39:10.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna put my foot up his fuckin' ass...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.54,0:39:10.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We're live, Gail.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.50,0:39:13.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Gail Hailstorm standing out front of the police station...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.84,0:39:16.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,where I'm going to try and get a glimpse of Cindy Campbell,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.30,0:39:18.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,the young girl who was attacked earlier this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.09,0:39:20.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're on my foot, fat shit!   - Sorry, G...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.01,0:39:21.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What did I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.01,0:39:23.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,"Don't ever step on Gail's shoes."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.97,0:39:24.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.47,0:39:25.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Because Gail wears Prada shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.60,0:39:26.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.26,0:39:27.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm a bad man.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.18,0:39:29.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Cindy, can we get a statement?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.52,0:39:30.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Buffy Gilmore, Miss Teen.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.19,0:39:32.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She's not talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.98,0:39:34.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Is it true the police have someone in custody?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.81,0:39:35.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Cindy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.98,0:39:37.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Cindy, Cindy, your ass looks fat!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.65,0:39:41.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.28,0:39:43.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Good shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.41,0:39:44.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.07,0:39:46.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, who copped a feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.87,0:39:47.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Gail, it was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.37,0:39:51.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, my God.   - It was an accident, Gail.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.58,0:39:53.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I only touched it, the top of the breast.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.42,0:39:55.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It was so tender and juicy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.84,0:39:56.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.59,0:40:08.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yo.   - Hello, Shorty. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.31,0:40:13.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Nothin'. Sittin' here watchin' the game. Smokin' some bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.60,0:40:17.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you all alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.15,0:40:19.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wassup?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.90,0:40:21.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wassup?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.78,0:40:23.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What the... Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.95,0:40:25.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yo, pick up the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.12,0:40:28.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wassup?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.33,0:40:30.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wassup?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.33,0:40:34.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yo, Dookie, pick up the phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.42,0:40:38.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yo.   - Wassup?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.30,0:40:52.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- What you doin', son?   - Nothin'. Just chillin', killin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.02,0:40:54.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,True. True.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.27,0:40:58.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So you think Bobby did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.07,0:41:04.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know. But he was there, Buffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.61,0:41:07.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I knew there had to be something. He's just too perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.53,0:41:11.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Handsome, smart, good in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.87,0:41:13.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.25,0:41:19.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Cind. Got your ice pack for your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.25,0:41:22.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.96,0:41:24.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll get you one for your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.26,0:41:27.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no, that's okay, Doofy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.30,0:41:30.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, we're gonna get that guy you dumped in the water. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.47,0:41:33.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll be next door if you need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.81,0:41:35.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Night, Cind.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.77,0:41:38.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Buffy, you told him?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.94,0:41:42.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The moron overheard a conversation Greg and I were having.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.05,0:41:43.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but what if he says something?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.65,0:41:46.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Who's gonna believe a retarded retard like him anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.24,0:41:47.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.12,0:41:49.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Cindy, telephone.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.25,0:41:52.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.01,0:41:54.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.38,0:41:56.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello, Cindy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.72,0:41:58.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Guess what.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.32,0:42:00.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.05,0:42:01.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You got the wrong guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.23,0:42:02.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.13,0:42:03.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Doofy!   - Yep, It's not Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.31,0:42:05.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.92,0:42:16.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.98,0:42:20.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.56,0:42:24.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I said don't disturb me while I'm cleaning my room!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.45,0:42:32.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I heard Bobby got out this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.75,0:42:36.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen him around. Is he pissed?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.09,0:42:39.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You mean since you branded him the Candyman?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.26,0:42:40.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No. His heart is broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.01,0:42:44.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yo, son. It's like I seen this all before.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.40,0:42:46.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They had a killer at your old high school, Shorty?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.52,0:42:48.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, it was in this movie Scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.16,0:42:50.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Same dialogue and everything. This is ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.95,0:42:52.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- How did it end?   - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.62,0:42:53.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Some niggas started shooting up in the movie theater,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.93,0:42:54.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,so we just broke out.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.63,0:42:57.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.29,0:43:00.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, I say we all just stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.07,0:43:01.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Tonight everyone meet at my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.28,0:43:05.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And bring some friends. But don't tell everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.10,0:43:06.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Try to keep it quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.48,0:43:07.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.44,0:43:12.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yo! Party at Cindy's house! Drunk white women for everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.71,0:43:18.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ray, if you see Bobby, tell him I love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.38,0:43:22.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. If I see Bobby, I'll tell him I love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.32,0:43:31.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.24,0:43:32.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's okay. It's all right. It's just me, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.03,0:43:35.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- What, you don't still think it's me, do you?   - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.83,0:43:37.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's just that somebody did try to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.67,0:43:39.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And the police said I scared him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.75,0:43:41.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I know. He called me last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.09,0:43:44.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You see, it couldn't have been me. I was in jail last night. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.65,0:43:49.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.27,0:43:52.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Please understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.20,0:43:54.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Understand what? That my girlfriend would rather
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.53,0:43:55.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,call me a killer than touch me?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.99,0:43:56.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's not true, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.54,0:43:57.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Then what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.70,0:44:00.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What is it? She's gone and she's not coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.63,0:44:01.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's been over a year, Cindy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.25,0:44:04.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But Ginger was such an important part of the Spice Girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.01,0:44:06.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, you gotta move on, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.06,0:44:10.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry if my complicated life...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.86,0:44:14.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,is an inconvenience to your perfect existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.98,0:44:17.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Cindy. Cind.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.53,0:44:19.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, everybody, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.22,0:44:21.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me just say, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.69,0:44:26.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,the killing of these teenagers has been tragic, but, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.66,0:44:28.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, you know, shit happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.95,0:44:30.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sheriff! Sheriff!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.79,0:44:34.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, Miss Thunderstorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.10,0:44:35.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Have they found Cindy Campbell's father?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.83,0:44:36.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.97,0:44:37.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Isn't he a suspect?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.93,0:44:40.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That is classified information. Where are you getting that?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.79,0:44:44.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but my sources are strictly confidential, Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.75,0:44:45.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Gail.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.69,0:44:48.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Gail swallows.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.99,0:44:56.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.73,0:45:02.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello. Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.32,0:45:03.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.57,0:45:06.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You wanna kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.99,0:45:09.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, God. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.54,0:45:10.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Cindy, it's for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.59,0:45:17.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, knock it off, Buffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.96,0:45:20.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, as you all have heard, there is a killer in town...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.72,0:45:23.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and the police have asked us to give you the following safety tips.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.35,0:45:25.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stay in well-lit areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.31,0:45:28.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do not travel alone whenever possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.23,0:45:31.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Always wipe front to back.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.44,0:45:33.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And remember, never, ever believe someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.19,0:45:36.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,when they tell you that shaving your pubic hair...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.84,0:45:38.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,will rid you of crab infestation.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.03,0:45:44.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, I understand this is a difficult time for you young ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.58,0:45:47.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So if anyone needs to come to my office to talk,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.05,0:45:48.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I am here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.43,0:45:54.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What a crock of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.01,0:45:56.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not, Buffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.60,0:45:57.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He's real!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.15,0:46:10.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Miss Mann?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.87,0:46:15.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come in, dear. Have a seat. Take off your bra if you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.08,0:46:19.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.17,0:46:22.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What can I do for you, Cindy?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.13,0:46:26.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I need to talk. See, I have this problem...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.76,0:46:28.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and I don't know who to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.47,0:46:31.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Not feeling so fresh?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.77,0:46:35.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Feminine odor and itching got you down?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.14,0:46:39.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Uh, no. No, not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.57,0:46:40.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Then what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.57,0:46:44.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I have a terrible secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.20,0:46:49.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, Cindy, we all have our little secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.91,0:46:53.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sometimes we do things we're not so proud of.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.00,0:46:56.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Some for money,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.71,0:47:00.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,others to gain the athletic edge on the competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.05,0:47:03.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sometimes those secrets come back to haunt us.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.47,0:47:05.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.10,0:47:09.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do, um, Miss Mann. Thanks for ball...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.48,0:47:13.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, all your help. I have to go to class.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.28,0:47:16.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Anytime, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.70,0:47:20.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Buffy, are you coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.03,0:47:22.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll catch up with you guys in a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.17,0:47:30.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Redrum.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.00,0:47:33.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.93,0:47:42.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Somebody there?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.94,0:47:45.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.40,0:47:53.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.91,0:47:55.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Who put you up to this, Cindy?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.58,0:47:57.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lose the cape. It's way too '90s horror.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.71,0:48:04.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, so what movie is this from, Die, Cheerleader, Die?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.88,0:48:08.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wanna play psycho killer?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.50,0:48:12.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Can I be the helpless cheerleader?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.14,0:48:16.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, so this is where I'm supposed to beg for my life?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.35,0:48:20.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Please, Mr. Killer, don't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.49,0:48:26.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So is this where I'm supposed to bleed?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.78,0:48:29.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, look, I'm bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.12,0:48:34.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I'm supposed to run, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.92,0:48:42.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. I'm running! I'm running! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.51,0:48:45.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Help! Now I'm gonna fall and break my leg, leaving me helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.31,0:48:52.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There you go, Mr. Scary Killer. I'm panicking now.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.98,0:48:56.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, God! Somebody please help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.03,0:48:59.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, God, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.70,0:49:03.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.37,0:49:06.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I guess this is the big climax.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.30,0:49:08.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hope you don't mind if I fake it. Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.55,0:49:15.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, look at me. I'm all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.63,0:49:19.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm a gross, scary severed head. Come on. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.43,0:49:21.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you know who I am? I'm Miss Teen.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.72,0:49:23.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're really giving me a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.18,0:49:25.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And you got blood all over my Gucci sweater.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.22,0:49:28.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I hope you're gonna pay for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.18,0:49:29.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ah! I will not be ignored by the likes...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.32,0:49:32.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.57,0:49:34.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Phil, get back in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.49,0:49:36.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- No!   - What are you doing up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.74,0:49:37.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Be reasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.16,0:49:43.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't take this fucking job or those greasy shithead teenagers anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.75,0:49:45.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm going to end it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.21,0:49:48.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait! Hold on! We're getting help for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.92,0:49:51.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now we know Bobby's not the killer. So who is?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.72,0:49:52.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.89,0:49:54.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If the killer was in your house last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.74,0:49:56.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,why didn't he just kill you then?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.07,0:49:57.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Because he's just messing with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.97,0:50:00.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't you see? He's got us right where he wants us.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.88,0:50:03.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We can't go to the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.09,0:50:05.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He's just out there watching us and waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.82,0:50:08.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.45,0:50:11.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.08,0:50:14.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.16,0:50:16.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What am I waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.87,0:50:18.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What am I waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.58,0:50:20.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.46,0:50:21.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.09,0:50:25.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.68,0:50:28.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ray, I still don't think this party is a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.68,0:50:31.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You know I'm not gonna let nothin' happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.60,0:50:32.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I just don't feel right.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.98,0:50:34.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why can't we just do something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.56,0:50:37.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,How about we go to the movies?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.36,0:50:40.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Huh? You like that? See a little movie, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.92,0:50:47.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! This is my song!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.62,0:50:49.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You know they gave me a shout-out on the album, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.16,0:50:50.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.58,0:50:50.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,ooh, Brenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.21,0:50:54.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Everywhere I go I see the same ho's
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.13,0:50:59.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Did I tell you how sexy you look in my jersey?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.18,0:51:01.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I do, Ray?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.14,0:51:02.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.06,0:51:05.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I like it. Hey, get up. Go over there. Let me see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.19,0:51:14.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ooh! Yes, I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.53,0:51:17.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- You like that? You like that?   - Yeah. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.99,0:51:18.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, put this on with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.62,0:51:22.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ray, you are so freaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.75,0:51:24.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's right. You know I'm freaky, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.00,0:51:28.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go on. Pull it. Pull it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.88,0:51:32.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Here. Put this on with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.05,0:51:35.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.14,0:51:37.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.64,0:51:43.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go on, girl. Go on. Pull it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.48,0:51:44.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Okay.   - Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.73,0:51:46.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I like that look.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.28,0:51:49.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ooh! I'm bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.70,0:51:51.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Here. Put this on with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.37,0:51:54.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go on, girl. Put it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.95,0:51:59.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Put that shit on there. Come on. Just shove it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.71,0:52:02.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do it. Yeah. Ooh, so fucking sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.84,0:52:05.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come here, girl. Bring your little sexy ass over here. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.51,0:52:09.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Full speed. Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.64,0:52:13.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes! Yes! Come on! Turn around!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.56,0:52:14.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Turn around! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.06,0:52:17.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, Brendan! Take it, Brendan! Take it, Brendan!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.02,0:52:18.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.23,0:52:21.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Uh... Uh, Brenda. Put the helmet on.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.53,0:52:22.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, let's role-play. Come on. You get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.40,0:52:25.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.12,0:52:27.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm here at Lover's Lookout.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.74,0:52:29.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's dark, it's in the middle of nowhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.33,0:52:32.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and it's where hormone-driven teens love to come and fool around.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.54,0:52:36.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So very likely we're about to see someone get killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.96,0:52:39.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, sure enough, there's a girl in that car,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.59,0:52:40.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,blouse unbuttoned, all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.88,0:52:42.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's see if she'll have a word with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.55,0:52:46.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hi. Gail Hailstorm, author of the new book You're Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.31,0:52:50.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Can you tell us your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.77,0:52:51.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, my name's Heather.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.73,0:52:54.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Can you tell us what you're doing out here all alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.94,0:52:56.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.46,0:52:58.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My boyfriend and I were just, like, making out...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.11,0:53:02.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and then we heard a noise out there, so he went to go check it,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.20,0:53:04.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,but... well, that was, like, ten minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.71,0:53:05.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah. Has it crossed your little mind that
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.86,0:53:08.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,your boyfriend was probably murdered...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.33,0:53:09.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and you're about to be slaughtered next?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.01,0:53:14.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Really? No way!   - Way.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.51,0:53:16.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Heather, good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.34,0:53:17.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, thanks, Gail. You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.72,0:53:21.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought. The murder is happening as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.10,0:53:24.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm going to try and break into the bloodshed.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.49,0:53:24.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you getting this?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.02,0:53:28.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Heather, can you tell us what you're feeling, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.73,0:53:31.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lots of pain. Gail, please help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.49,0:53:32.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Gail, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.57,0:53:34.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd like to help you out, kid, but it's sweeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.49,0:53:35.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sir, sir, can I get a word with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.04,0:53:37.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You got a lot of nerve coming here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.75,0:53:39.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm just trying to do my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.41,0:53:40.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get the camera off me now! You're dead, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.62,0:53:41.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, Kenny, keep rolling!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.67,0:53:44.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna slice your head off and shove it up his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.71,0:53:45.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get that camera off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.73,0:53:47.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God, Kenny!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.65,0:53:50.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Kenny, move your fat ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.29,0:53:54.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Kenny! Oh, my God, he's right behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.39,0:53:55.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This man is chasin'Miss Gail.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.07,0:54:04.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm so scared right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.82,0:54:11.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I just want to say... to the family of my cameraman, Kenny,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.41,0:54:14.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.58,0:54:18.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This was my interview,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.09,0:54:20.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,my story.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.30,0:54:22.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.43,0:54:30.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You want some popcorn?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.92,0:54:32.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh. I brought me a little snack of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.57,0:54:39.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- You want some chicken?   - Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.37,0:54:45.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm. For all y'all talkers up in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.75,0:54:47.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,it's time to keep it down right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.04,0:54:50.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Shh, back at you. Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.63,0:54:55.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why they actin' already?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.76,0:54:57.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It ain't nothin' but the previews.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.10,0:55:03.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The largest ship the world had ever known.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.19,0:55:09.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Its 400 passengers and crew on a maiden voyage to a brave new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.40,0:55:12.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ajourney that would change their lives forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.41,0:55:19.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm the king of the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.30,0:55:28.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get your ass back down there, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.67,0:55:29.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go to the bathroom real quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.76,0:55:30.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The movie about to come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.05,0:55:33.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- I gotta go to the bathroom.   - Here. Take your hot sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.97,0:55:35.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, man. Don't be long.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.52,0:55:38.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Back up! Let him through!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.15,0:55:43.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You can move back some. You don't own the theater.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.12,0:55:52.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And they're off!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.16,0:55:54.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's number three in the lead. Number two close behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.58,0:55:56.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And number three is the winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.59,0:56:03.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Number two has placed, and number four to show.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.22,0:56:06.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Next week's Triple Crown starts at 2:30.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.72,0:56:08.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Be here early.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.92,0:56:37.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.22,0:56:41.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go ahead. Do it again. Do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.00,0:57:01.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mm-mmm! Don't go in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.26,0:57:11.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lord, I'm gonna have a heart attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.34,0:57:13.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Man, this is some scary shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.30,0:57:15.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, I am scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.51,0:57:17.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.35,0:57:21.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I think I paid my money like everybody else up in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.90,0:57:24.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That ain't no man.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.53,0:57:26.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You can see her real hair right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.65,0:57:27.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.53,0:57:31.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I know you better get outta my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.78,0:57:34.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Outta my face! Outta my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.29,0:57:36.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This is all me up in here. You handle that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.25,0:57:38.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Will you shut the fuck up!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.34,0:57:42.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mmm, mmm. This movie is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.34,0:57:47.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, baby. You came back just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.97,0:57:50.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She's about to get it on with Shakespeare.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.51,0:57:53.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- She dressing like a man...   - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.27,0:57:56.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got you. I got you on camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.94,0:57:58.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You on Candid Camera now.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.19,0:58:01.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You ain't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.20,0:58:07.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello. Hey, girl. Uh-uh. I'm in the movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.66,0:58:11.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Shakespeare In Love.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.46,0:58:13.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh. Ooh! You lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.54,0:58:17.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,For Christ's sake, will you just shut your trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.13,0:58:19.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Shut up!   - Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.63,0:58:22.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know why y'all is actin'like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.35,0:58:24.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My girlfriend already seen the movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.14,0:58:25.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She said they don't even stay together in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.73,0:58:29.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Give me that. Right on.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.77,0:58:33.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Will you sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.69,0:58:35.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.61,0:58:38.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Your ass is grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.95,0:58:45.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- This is for Thelma   - And Louise!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.42,0:58:46.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This is for talking through The Fugitive!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.37,0:58:49.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- You ruined Schindler's List.   - Jackie Chan movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.50,0:58:52.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Boogie Nights!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.59,0:58:54.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And Big Momma's House!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.24,0:59:14.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And I cannot marry the daughter of Sir Robert De Lesseps.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.46,0:59:21.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Um, you guys, there's a few too many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.75,0:59:24.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, honey, please don't throw... Hey, you guys, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.84,0:59:27.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey, please! That's my dad's!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.97,0:59:30.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- No, don't touch... Ah, no!   - Do you have more beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.22,0:59:31.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you have more beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.18,0:59:33.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Um, yeah. Uh, check in the garage.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.35,0:59:35.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no! Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.34,1:00:00.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Kitty, you scared me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.64,1:00:08.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Horsey. Oh, you scared me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.73,1:00:15.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello? Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.61,1:00:21.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God! Oh, my God! Please, don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.95,1:00:24.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Please! I'm just a day player!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.93,1:01:15.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Chug! Chug! Chug! Chug! Chug! Chug! Chug!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.65,1:01:25.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, Bobby. Bobby. I was worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.07,1:01:28.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought the killer got to you before I could.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.62,1:01:30.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Could what?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.54,1:01:34.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I wanna go upstairs. There's something I wanna show you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.92,1:01:40.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, party on!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.39,1:01:49.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- So...   - So.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.43,1:01:52.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Here we are... again.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.78,1:01:59.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And, you know, if you're not ready,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.95,1:02:02.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.37,1:02:06.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Bobby. I am ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.67,1:02:10.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- You are?   - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.80,1:02:16.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't keep fighting these urges.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.97,1:02:19.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I have to just give in to them...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.22,1:02:22.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and let them flow.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.18,1:02:22.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.45,1:02:25.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.44,1:02:29.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I have been so selfish.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.53,1:02:33.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This is like a scene from a movie or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.20,1:02:35.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Only it isn't a movie, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.70,1:02:37.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This is real life.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.87,1:02:41.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's all a movie, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.50,1:02:44.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There's the sound guy. There's the script supervisor.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.65,1:02:46.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,How ya doin', baby?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.05,1:02:47.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Bobby?   - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.26,1:02:53.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What I mean is that in real life...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.14,1:02:56.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,you have to enjoy each moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.46,1:02:57.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Bobby. Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.06,1:03:32.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Can I tell you a secret?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.19,1:03:35.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sure, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.27,1:03:39.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I see dead people.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.16,1:03:43.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Man, this shit is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.24,1:03:47.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yo, son, we gotta roll some more of that shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.25,1:03:50.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We don't have any more papers, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.46,1:03:52.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We don't have any more papers.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.46,1:03:56.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, man! What can we use to make a bong?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.35,1:04:04.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Toke! Toke! Toke! Toke! Toke! Toke! Toke!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.51,1:04:05.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Toke! Toke! Toke! Toke! Toke! Toke! Toke! Toke!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.40,1:04:15.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit, son!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.87,1:04:22.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This some good shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.32,1:04:51.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Bobby! I've never done this before.   - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.87,1:04:54.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.41,1:04:58.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's just like... It's like sucking on a Tootsie Roll Pop.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.54,1:05:01.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- ATootsie Pop?   - Yeah, a cherry-flavor one.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.42,1:05:03.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,With the fudge in the middle?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.87,1:05:07.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.04,1:05:13.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.59,1:05:15.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just like that, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.23,1:05:23.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh! Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.86,1:05:27.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I never could wait to get to the chewy middle.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.58,1:05:30.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- You know, let me.   - Oh.Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.75,1:05:32.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Goddamn!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.74,1:06:00.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Guess it's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.46,1:06:12.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's very, uh, '70s of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.69,1:06:31.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.92,1:06:37.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come here, Bobby! I want it now!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.66,1:06:41.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, am I fuckin' stoned!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.83,1:06:43.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me too, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.71,1:06:44.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys hear that?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.31,1:07:03.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.11,1:07:04.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hello?   - Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.53,1:07:07.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's your favorite scary movie?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.92,1:07:12.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me talk to her. Shh!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.25,1:07:17.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna gut you like a pig!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.42,1:07:25.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.17,1:07:27.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.09,1:07:29.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's my name, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.06,1:07:31.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.06,1:07:33.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's my name, bitch?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.35,1:07:34.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ow! God!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.07,1:07:35.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's Cindy!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.30,1:07:36.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Whose is it, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.50,1:07:38.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Whose is it, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.50,1:07:39.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.91,1:07:46.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.88,1:07:55.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.94,1:08:45.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yo! That was the illest rhyme I ever seen, son!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.85,1:08:48.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Bobby...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.18,1:08:51.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,where were you tonight?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.44,1:08:53.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.46,1:08:56.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I was just curious.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.42,1:08:58.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What took you so long to get here?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.46,1:08:59.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why you so curious?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.46,1:09:02.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.51,1:09:05.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought it would fit the '90s horror cliche...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.84,1:09:08.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,if you turned out to be the killer.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.02,1:09:10.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, so, what? You thinkI killed Buffy and Greg?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.19,1:09:14.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Buffy and Greg are dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.40,1:09:17.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought you knew that.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.11,1:09:20.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God! Bobby, turn around!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.15,1:09:21.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's the killer!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.79,1:09:36.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Cindy!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.51,1:09:38.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.60,1:09:40.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Bobby! Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.17,1:09:41.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Cindy. Help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.94,1:09:43.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Bobby, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.14,1:09:44.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Gimme the gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.80,1:09:48.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be okay, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.79,1:09:51.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yo, wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.65,1:09:53.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There's a killer in the house!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.86,1:09:55.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There's ass, blood and guts everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.85,1:09:57.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Someone done gone crazy, son!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.73,1:10:01.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We all go a little crazy sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.16,1:10:03.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Bobby, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.08,1:10:06.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit, son!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.42,1:10:09.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.43,1:10:14.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Cindy, he shot me in the lungs.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.26,1:10:17.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You wanna hit this shit?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.44,1:10:23.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ketchup.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.23,1:10:26.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just like my mom puts on her spaghetti, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.95,1:10:30.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God! Ray, you've gotta help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.41,1:10:31.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Bobby's gone crazy!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.02,1:10:34.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.21,1:10:37.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Surprise, Cindy!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.27,1:10:52.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.45,1:10:55.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why? Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.42,1:10:56.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You hear that, Ray?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.52,1:10:57.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I think she wants a motive.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.73,1:11:00.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Did Scream have a plot?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.44,1:11:01.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.83,1:11:04.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Did I Know What You Did Last Summer make any sense?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.31,1:11:06.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't think so!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.59,1:11:07.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What about the sequel?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.34,1:11:09.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What was with that fat, whiteJamaican kid?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.41,1:11:11.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I wanna kill that motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.05,1:11:12.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It was bad casting, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.03,1:11:15.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,How about this for a motive? Lack of sex!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.71,1:11:18.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It can cause serious deviant behavior.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.30,1:11:21.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought you loved me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.67,1:11:24.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, I did, baby. I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.35,1:11:26.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But abstinence can make you discover new things about yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.39,1:11:29.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's right, Cindy. I'm gay.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.44,1:11:31.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And in case you haven't noticed,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.77,1:11:32.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,so is Ray.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.94,1:11:36.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What? I ain't gay.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.86,1:11:37.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? You took me to that club.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.74,1:11:40.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So, they play good music.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.74,1:11:42.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What about our trip to San Francisco, then?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.57,1:11:44.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I wanted to go shopping.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.55,1:11:49.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- But you made love to me.   - No. First of all, you sucked my...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.40,1:11:51.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Whatever, Ray! I don't want to talk about this now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.08,1:11:53.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The point is, I'm a new man,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.70,1:11:56.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and I'm ready to leave all this behind and start a new life.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.89,1:11:58.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So you killed all your friends?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.14,1:11:59.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.52,1:12:02.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just you. And maybe Shorty,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.02,1:12:04.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,but that wasn't planned or anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.98,1:12:07.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But here's the genius part.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.07,1:12:09.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We're copycatting a serial killer that already exists.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.36,1:12:11.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's the perfect crime, Cindy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.91,1:12:14.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But wait! There's more!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.08,1:12:17.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hang on to your seat, baby,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.26,1:12:19.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,cause this one's a screamer!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.67,1:12:21.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.93,1:12:25.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Move your big ass.Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.89,1:12:26.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.23,1:12:29.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do, frame him?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.75,1:12:33.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Nah. We're just havin' a little bit of fun with old daddio.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.94,1:12:38.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The police are gonna find you and daddy both dead,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.36,1:12:41.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and me and Ray are the only survivors of a maniac's revenge.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.69,1:12:42.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.25,1:12:43.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- You ready?   - I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.43,1:12:45.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to do this shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.90,1:12:46.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Come on.   - All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.43,1:12:47.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Come on.   - All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.87,1:12:49.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Come on!   - Give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.44,1:12:50.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No! Wait, wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.46,1:12:55.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- All right. Ready? Let's do this.   - Wait, wait. Ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.88,1:12:57.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Come on. Come on.   - Ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.40,1:12:58.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.90,1:13:00.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No! Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.66,1:13:02.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Remember what we talked about? To the side.   - I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.65,1:13:03.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- How many times we gonna go over this?   - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.00,1:13:07.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop. Just... All right. Trust me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.30,1:13:07.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- All right. I'm ready.   - Trust me. I got this shit. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.85,1:13:08.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Ready?   - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.99,1:13:10.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.65,1:13:12.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm about to cut your throat, boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.71,1:13:14.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop acting like a little girl. Come on. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.91,1:13:16.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're right, you're right, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.02,1:13:17.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.86,1:13:21.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No! You guys are psychos!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.45,1:13:23.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You've seen one too many TV shows!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.29,1:13:28.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No! Watching television shows doesn't create psycho killers!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.63,1:13:30.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Cancelin' TV shows does!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.29,1:13:33.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The Wayans Brothers was a good show, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.76,1:13:36.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It was a good-ass show,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.44,1:13:37.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and we didn't even get a final episode!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.14,1:13:40.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Take it easy! I'm feelin' a little woozy here!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.85,1:13:44.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's my turn. Give me the knife.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.35,1:13:47.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Fuck outta here. Ain't nobody stabbin' me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.74,1:13:56.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Surprise, Cindy!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.60,1:14:51.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.63,1:14:53.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.96,1:14:56.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just give me a moment. Ah. One...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.62,1:15:05.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. That's it. Ah. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.43,1:15:43.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.88,1:15:45.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.17,1:15:48.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought I told you not to have a party unless I was here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.70,1:15:51.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But, Dad, you were here. You were in the closet.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.55,1:15:52.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.44,1:15:54.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Did you get some girlfriends' numbers for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.51,1:15:56.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Dad, they're dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.97,1:15:58.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ah, you know, I can't get a break.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.85,1:15:59.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's that? Is that the cops?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.94,1:16:03.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, listen, honey. Help me up now.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.48,1:16:06.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Uh... Uh... If the cops come, tell 'em I'm a plumber, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.65,1:16:09.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You had a leaky faucet, and you called, and they sent me over.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.32,1:16:10.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We don't know each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.22,1:16:18.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.68,1:16:21.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Dad, Dad, put your arms down.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.40,1:16:25.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell's goin' on here?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.44,1:16:26.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sheriff, it's a bloodbath in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.65,1:16:28.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He was right here! I swear it!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.90,1:16:29.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Who was?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.44,1:16:32.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The killer! The guy that murdered all my friends!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.03,1:16:36.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And the sick bastard planted drugs all in the house there.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.51,1:16:37.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All over the place.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.33,1:16:39.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Dad. Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.04,1:16:41.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, Cindy. I'm gonna have to take you down to the station.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.92,1:16:45.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm cool, though, right? I'm okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.59,1:16:46.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's... Let's go, Cindy.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.67,1:16:49.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Cindy. Call me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.26,1:16:52.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Daddy'll get you out, honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.89,1:16:59.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go over this again.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.54,1:17:12.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You say it was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.70,1:17:13.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.66,1:17:14.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He was on the road.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.25,1:17:16.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And you think he came back to get revenge?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.92,1:17:17.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It has to be him, Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.64,1:17:27.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Here, Sheriff. They wanted me to give this to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.06,1:17:30.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- That'll be all, Doofy.   - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.18,1:17:32.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm gonna go, then. All right.   - All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.26,1:17:36.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Bye, Cind.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.17,1:17:41.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Cindy. It wasn't the man you guys killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.95,1:17:43.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,His name was David Keegan.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.62,1:17:45.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Some fishermen found his body a few weeks later.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.24,1:17:46.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He's buried in Lakewood Cemetery.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.74,1:17:48.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.96,1:17:52.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Then I don't know who it could be.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.42,1:17:54.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He's gotta be someone... who was connected with all the victims,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.67,1:17:56.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,someone who knew about the accident.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.05,1:17:59.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Someone who could move around without being noticed.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.27,1:18:03.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.56,1:18:07.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She used to baby-sit my brother Doofy.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.20,1:18:08.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He had the biggest crush on her.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.48,1:18:11.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's me, Cind.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.65,1:18:13.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Night, Cind.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.70,1:18:18.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Doofy!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.06,1:18:19.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Shithead?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.21,1:18:24.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Have you seen Doofy?   - No
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.55,1:18:25.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Have you seen Doofy?   - No, Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.86,1:18:27.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Has anybody seen Doofy?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.26,1:18:27.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.34,1:18:29.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Just went out the back, Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.51,1:19:29.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.97,1:19:44.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Shit, son. Yo, what the deal?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.60,1:19:47.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yo, if y'all watchin' this tape right now,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.56,1:19:49.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,that means I didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.15,1:19:54.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Either I'm a prisoner, or worse, dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.28,1:19:55.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But either way it goes,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.67,1:19:58.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna tell you all the rules to survive this situation.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.70,1:20:01.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Rule number one: You gotta be quick.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.16,1:20:04.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Rule number two: Don't fall down.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.58,1:20:09.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And rule number three: Whatever you do, never look back.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.80,1:20:12.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Y'all wish me luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.84,1:20:14.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Snatch and run, y'all!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.81,1:20:19.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come back here, you motherfuckers! Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.49,1:27:21.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This isn't easy for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.68,1:27:23.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I know we've been together a long time,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.33,1:27:26.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,but I found somebody else.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.13,1:27:28.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay? I'm in love.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.79,1:27:33.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me like that!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.34,1:27:36.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We could still be friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.10,1:27:38.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You can come into my room whenever you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.43,1:27:41.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We just can't... No.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.19,1:27:45.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.94,1:27:50.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, just one time.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.04,1:28:00.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. That's it!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.56,1:28:02.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoo! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.80,0:04:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,《惊声尖笑》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.68,0:00:20.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.63,0:00:22.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,想找乐子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.59,0:00:23.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.72,0:00:24.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你先说你的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.61,0:00:26.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我才不要
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.72,0:00:28.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,什么声音
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.02,0:00:30.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我放屁了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.02,0:00:32.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没想到你听得见
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.73,0:00:33.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不 那噗噗的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.98,0:00:36.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我在做爆米花
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.07,0:00:38.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,准备看片子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.19,0:00:40.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,什么片子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.28,0:00:41.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,只是部恐怖片
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.91,0:00:43.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你喜欢恐怖片吗  - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.91,0:00:44.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你最喜欢哪一部
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.58,0:00:46.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:48.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,想想嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.29,0:00:50.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有了 是精灵也疯狂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.91,0:00:52.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,侠客欧尼尔演精灵的那一部
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.65,0:00:54.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那不是恐怖片
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.88,0:00:56.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那是你没看过欧尼尔的演技
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:00:59.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你的声音很甜美
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.26,0:01:01.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.38,0:01:03.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你没告诉我你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.84,0:01:05.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你为何想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.01,0:01:07.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我想知道我现在正在看的是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.56,0:01:12.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.10,0:01:14.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,大波霸
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.44,0:01:16.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你想干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.90,0:01:18.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我想看看你里面有没有料
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.73,0:01:21.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那就翻到55页
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:25.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.83,0:01:29.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,混球 你闹够了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.12,0:01:31.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你最好就此打住
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.12,0:01:32.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不然呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.04,0:01:34.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我男友随时会到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.79,0:01:37.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他是黑人 可以扁死你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.38,0:01:37.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.17,0:01:38.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.79,0:01:40.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是指打扮成女人的那个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.34,0:01:42.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.63,0:01:44.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把阳台的灯打开
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.97,0:01:54.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,救命 救命
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.31,0:01:55.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不是他啦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.98,0:01:57.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不过就跟他上过几次床而已
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.73,0:02:01.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要报警了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.73,0:02:03.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,去啊 去报警啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.19,0:02:06.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但你最好先查看一下后门
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.95,0:02:08.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你忘了上锁了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.97,0:02:33.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,接招吧 大变态
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.98,0:02:39.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我的脚没知觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.77,0:02:42.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我的手断了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.44,0:02:43.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.86,0:02:45.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要跟我妈讲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.70,0:02:50.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你好 茱儿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.87,0:02:57.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.75,0:03:08.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.80,0:03:16.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(活路 死路)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.77,0:03:19.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.11,0:04:11.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.86,0:04:12.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.70,0:04:16.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.80,0:04:18.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.47,0:04:20.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爸 不 不
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.71,0:04:25.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,什么声音
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.58,0:04:27.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我没听见什么声音
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.82,0:04:57.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,巴比 你干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.41,0:04:58.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我爸就在隔壁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.87,0:04:59.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我想起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.43,0:05:01.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我从未从窗户爬进来过
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.94,0:05:03.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,现在你满足了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.45,0:05:05.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.29,0:05:06.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.33,0:05:08.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.83,0:05:11.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,里面怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.25,0:05:12.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,老爸的头卡住了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.59,0:05:13.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快松开
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.13,0:05:17.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爸 拜托你先敲门嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.55,0:05:18.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,敲门
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.34,0:05:19.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我听见里面有人尖叫
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.76,0:05:21.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没有人尖叫啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.60,0:05:24.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,可能是我刚嗑药的幻觉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.60,0:05:25.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.23,0:05:28.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要离开镇上几天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.02,0:05:29.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.65,0:05:32.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我跟那几个哥伦比亚人的生意
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.19,0:05:33.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是说艾斯可叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.40,0:05:34.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.44,0:05:35.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,出了问题
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.90,0:05:37.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有些钱不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.36,0:05:39.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看来有些人会完了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.20,0:05:41.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我最好还是躲个几天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.49,0:05:42.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果警察来查
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.37,0:05:43.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我根本不认识你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.24,0:05:44.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.24,0:05:46.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,湮灭证据
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.04,0:05:48.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.58,0:05:49.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.92,0:05:51.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我在咖啡罐里留了点好料给你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.13,0:05:55.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 爸爸  - 卖之前记得要掺点料
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.17,0:05:56.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你要拿什么掺进去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.38,0:05:58.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,苏打
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.38,0:06:00.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,苏打粉不是发粉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.34,0:06:01.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,放发粉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.51,0:06:03.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,帅哥就会发了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.55,0:06:05.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你就喜欢这样 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.56,0:06:07.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你两岁时就喜欢这样掺了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.27,0:06:10.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.44,0:06:10.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:11.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.48,0:06:13.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一路顺风
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.15,0:06:15.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 拜  - 拜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.15,0:06:18.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,安全了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.78,0:06:21.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,辛蒂这件睡衣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.20,0:06:24.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真惊险 天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.74,0:06:31.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我本来在家看大法师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.54,0:06:32.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那片子却让我想起你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.87,0:06:34.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,若你是想起我吐绿黏液
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.04,0:06:36.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,还用十字架自慰的那次
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.92,0:06:38.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那是我第一次参加饮酒大会
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.21,0:06:41.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不 不
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.13,0:06:42.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那是电视版
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.22,0:06:43.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,精彩片段都剪了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.09,0:06:46.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那你是想爬上来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.77,0:06:48.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,跟我玩耍
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.47,0:06:51.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是希望有人能舔我蛋蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.31,0:06:53.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但我决不会动你内裤
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.04,0:06:53.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.56,0:06:57.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,也许我能跟你隔着睡衣玩玩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.73,0:07:03.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 就一下子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.72,0:07:19.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,搞什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.80,0:07:22.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,跑错场景了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.14,0:07:27.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,巴比
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.76,0:07:29.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,巴比
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.44,0:07:35.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,巴比 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.15,0:07:39.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.93,0:07:40.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(禁止入内)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.36,0:07:42.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是我爸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.32,0:07:47.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好了 大种马 你该走了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.99,0:07:55.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,关于上床的事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.58,0:07:56.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我并不想逼你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.21,0:07:59.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你接受辅导级的画面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.29,0:08:01.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.30,0:08:05.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.63,0:08:07.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,晚安 巴比
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.68,0:08:16.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,矮子你好吵
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.02,0:08:19.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,记得今天要去上课
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.60,0:08:20.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我会去上课的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.98,0:08:22.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,吃便当不叫上课
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.98,0:08:24.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,偷吃零食总算吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.23,0:08:27.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看吧 你就是这么蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.49,0:08:28.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,去你妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.53,0:08:33.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是我弟 那也是你妈
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.13,0:08:34.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.42,0:08:36.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那你爸是猪头
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.91,0:08:38.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,又怎样 我又不知他是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.58,0:08:40.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.17,0:08:43.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,辣妹 准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.96,0:08:44.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一会就好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.17,0:08:49.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快点 我们迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.26,0:08:50.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,等等 帕妃来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.01,0:08:53.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你干嘛跟她混
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.22,0:08:55.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她是个贱货
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.06,0:08:56.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你干嘛这样说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.18,0:08:58.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.56,0:09:01.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我朋友小席夏天开了泳池派对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.02,0:09:01.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,小席
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.98,0:09:02.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道的 吹牛老爹
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.48,0:09:06.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,大家都在喝法国香槟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.69,0:09:07.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,接着大家都发疯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.98,0:09:09.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,在池里乱搞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.40,0:09:14.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我看到 她在按摩池跟男人乱搞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.91,0:09:15.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那又怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.37,0:09:18.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对方是个伴舞的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.25,0:09:20.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那真是没格调
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.08,0:09:22.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那比跟警卫搞还没品
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.83,0:09:25.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,至少警卫能放你进场看演唱会
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.92,0:09:27.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她真不自爱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.42,0:09:28.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.05,0:09:30.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得帕妃很甜美
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.59,0:09:33.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她假仙死了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.93,0:09:35.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 小甜甜
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.26,0:09:39.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你好 好姊妹
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.14,0:09:41.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 拜 吉先生  - 拜
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.27,0:09:44.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他走了  - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.71,0:09:53.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨 辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.24,0:09:59.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我喜欢这个颜色
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.16,0:10:00.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,让我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.45,0:10:05.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们不该用这个牌子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.46,0:10:06.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.33,0:10:08.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们拿产品在动物身上试验
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.57,0:10:08.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,所以呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.29,0:10:13.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看过他们怎么对待那些动物吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.47,0:10:16.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(停止动物试验)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.93,0:10:19.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我很关心大众
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.72,0:10:22.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我愿意接济世上饥贫的孩童
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.10,0:10:25.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我宁可帮助人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.27,0:10:26.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,给我一元吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.81,0:10:28.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,滚远一点脏鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.44,0:10:30.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他只是饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.40,0:10:33.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拿去吧 这是三明治
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.57,0:10:35.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.19,0:10:37.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要的是一元
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.99,0:10:43.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊 看看这地方
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.95,0:10:45.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真像马戏团大公演
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.08,0:10:47.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们好 我是海盖儿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.00,0:10:50.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,畅销书《你死我赚》的作者
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.25,0:10:53.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一个小镇因一椿事故
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.38,0:10:55.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,陷入恐慌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.51,0:10:58.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一位少女惨遭残酷谋杀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.63,0:10:59.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我受够了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.55,0:11:00.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,两位青少年死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.43,0:11:03.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这个小镇陷入混乱中
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.85,0:11:05.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这种时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.35,0:11:06.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,警方到处寻找线索
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.93,0:11:09.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,目前并未找到目击证人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.52,0:11:10.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,也没有逮捕嫌疑犯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.10,0:11:13.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,警方请求民众协助破案
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.23,0:11:14.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,黑人电台为您报导
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.32,0:11:16.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,白人死了 我们快走
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.40,0:11:19.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快落跑啊 妈的快收拾好走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.43,0:11:26.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你想媒体会访问我们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.83,0:11:27.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.84,0:11:30.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,媒体只想访问最无知的人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.62,0:11:32.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我上电视了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.88,0:11:35.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,上回是被捕时上的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.59,0:11:37.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊 我会变成名人的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.05,0:11:39.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,请你谈谈遇害的茱儿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.34,0:11:41.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她的屁股真大
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.93,0:11:43.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,大辣妹
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.51,0:11:45.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你跟她熟吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.18,0:11:45.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,很熟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.45,0:11:47.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,强暴丸药效过后
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.80,0:11:49.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她说要告我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.89,0:11:51.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,所以我就不继续舔她屁屁了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.48,0:11:54.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你想对茱儿说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.94,0:11:57.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,跑 贱货快跑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.78,0:12:03.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,兄弟 我这样穿像同志吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.45,0:12:05.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不像
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.04,0:12:08.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,现在呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.62,0:12:12.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不像  - 酷吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.40,0:12:12.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.10,0:12:13.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拿一张吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.87,0:12:15.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别忘了周二投票
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.46,0:12:16.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别忘了周二投票
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.46,0:12:21.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,该死 他妈的旦旦面
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.84,0:12:23.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.93,0:12:26.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我的成绩单
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.26,0:12:31.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,白痴 至少里面还有个A嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.10,0:12:34.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对喔 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.10,0:12:37.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你真聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.77,0:12:40.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有看到巴比吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.82,0:12:42.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.49,0:12:43.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那家伙老爱迟到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.90,0:12:46.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我真不懂 他住的那么近
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.54,0:12:59.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,回头见了 老爸 老妈 吉姆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.75,0:13:01.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,大小吉姆瘦吉姆 还有大家
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.26,0:13:03.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拜了 小弟回头见
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.64,0:13:12.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,辣妹
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.10,0:13:15.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我真想钻进你裤裆里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.89,0:13:16.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.89,0:13:18.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊 你穿几号的裤子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.02,0:13:21.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,大家好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.23,0:13:25.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 嗨 巴比  - 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.74,0:13:26.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你好吗  - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.45,0:13:28.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有看到那些记者吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.43,0:13:29.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,听说了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.82,0:13:31.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,听说辣妹茱儿昨晚被人杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.70,0:13:33.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我想我认识她
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.12,0:13:34.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.87,0:13:36.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对 她哥叫史提夫吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.87,0:13:37.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.75,0:13:40.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,留长发 樱桃小嘴 俏屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.83,0:13:41.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是她没错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.88,0:13:43.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不 我说的是史提夫
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.00,0:13:45.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他到底发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.46,0:13:47.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们觉得她在整整一年后
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.81,0:13:50.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,被人谋杀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.54,0:13:53.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,跟我们杀了那人 有关系吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.47,0:13:56.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那是意外
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.85,0:13:58.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是吗 格瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.79,0:14:17.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你看他们在搞什么鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.41,0:14:19.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们何时才能做那档事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.08,0:14:22.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,总有一天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.96,0:14:26.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你喜欢吗  - 喜欢 真特别
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.21,0:14:27.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你喜欢  - 我爽透了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.38,0:14:30.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我喜欢你摸我屁屁
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.13,0:14:32.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我没摸你屁屁
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.20,0:14:36.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,小雷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.60,0:14:37.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我弄错了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.60,0:14:39.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.82,0:14:42.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,巴比 放点音乐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.31,0:14:44.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.86,0:14:45.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,放这卷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.01,0:14:52.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真是棒呆了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.28,0:14:57.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.59,0:14:58.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,停
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.50,0:15:01.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.64,0:15:03.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这很经典呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.97,0:15:05.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,听收音机吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.13,0:15:28.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 怎么 那是我妈的  - 搞什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.24,0:15:38.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.33,0:15:41.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.16,0:15:42.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,再靠近一点
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.95,0:15:44.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你想跟我说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.54,0:15:48.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.13,0:15:50.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我只要你摸摸它 拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.38,0:15:52.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,摸一下就好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.97,0:16:01.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我就想要你这样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.48,0:16:12.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.12,0:16:15.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.11,0:16:18.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.24,0:16:30.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我的老天
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.71,0:16:32.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.38,0:16:33.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我想我们撞到东西了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.76,0:16:40.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.89,0:16:45.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你看车子撞的 我爸会发飙的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.85,0:16:48.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我没看到 它突然钻出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.73,0:16:50.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊 我们撞上一只靴子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.65,0:16:51.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,脚呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.85,0:16:52.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.90,0:16:54.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,搞什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.44,0:16:59.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,尸体在那
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.32,0:17:00.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,妈的 他死了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.74,0:17:01.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.57,0:17:03.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 去看一下  - 我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.49,0:17:06.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 妈的  - 我们得报警
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.49,0:17:07.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不行 我不要坐牢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.87,0:17:08.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一定得报警
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.79,0:17:11.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,知道少男被送进牢会怎样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.04,0:17:15.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那些性饥渴的囚犯就等着你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.29,0:17:18.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,也许我们该报警
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.63,0:17:19.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真好啊 小雷
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.98,0:17:20.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,布兰妲呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.01,0:17:22.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你以为她想坐牢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.43,0:17:23.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是过失杀人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.57,0:17:24.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.83,0:17:26.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,等着被关十到十五年吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.79,0:17:27.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,闭嘴 巴比
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.43,0:17:31.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我没事  - 麻烦大了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.64,0:17:32.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.69,0:17:34.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别想把责任推给我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.77,0:17:36.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊 我们得毁尸灭迹
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.90,0:17:38.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不需要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.07,0:17:39.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你终于动脑袋了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.74,0:17:41.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 把他丢进海里  - 丢码头边
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.11,0:17:43.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我马上走
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.24,0:17:44.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.20,0:17:45.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 酒呢  - 丢了它
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.16,0:17:47.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不会有问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.20,0:17:48.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没错 动手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.99,0:17:50.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把他塞进后车厢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.54,0:17:52.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不想跟这件事有关连
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.62,0:17:53.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.42,0:17:56.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,辛蒂 拜托 我们就假装什么都没发生过
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.79,0:17:58.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就像我们喝醉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.06,0:17:59.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,乱搞那次一样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.59,0:18:01.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我抓他的手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.42,0:18:02.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我抓其他只手  - 我抓他屁屁
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.05,0:18:06.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们把他丢到威森湾里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.64,0:18:07.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,鲨鱼会帮我们料理他
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.31,0:18:11.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊 有人来了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.56,0:18:13.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,该死是矮子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.48,0:18:14.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,布兰妲 搞定他
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.61,0:18:23.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,矮子 你一定是无照驾驶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.32,0:18:26.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我有 我罩子亮着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.82,0:18:29.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,还有令人精神振奋的好料
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.20,0:18:33.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你在这干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.20,0:18:34.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,小雷啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.25,0:18:36.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,需要接电吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.33,0:18:38.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不 不用
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.38,0:18:40.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,很好 反正我也没带
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.34,0:18:43.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,回家去 矮子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.80,0:18:45.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,回头见
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.30,0:18:46.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拜了 小雷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.47,0:18:48.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把后车厢关上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.80,0:18:49.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,关不起来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.60,0:18:50.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.37,0:19:17.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托 等等把他放下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.94,0:19:19.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他真重 天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.38,0:19:25.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好听着 数到三就把他丢下去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.84,0:19:28.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,等等 检查一下他的皮夹吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.47,0:19:29.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.82,0:19:31.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他也许有钱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.60,0:19:34.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们已杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.03,0:19:35.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就顺便抢他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.39,0:19:35.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我拿信用卡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.35,0:19:37.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要珠宝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.43,0:19:38.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要他的内裤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.68,0:19:42.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,放手 他的内裤是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.02,0:19:47.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我拿到金戒指了  - 信用卡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.23,0:19:49.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把他丢进水里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.37,0:19:50.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.95,0:19:51.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,现在还不迟
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.03,0:19:53.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,闭嘴 好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.53,0:19:55.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊 我动手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.37,0:19:57.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把他丢进水里就好 好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.54,0:20:00.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一 二
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.54,0:20:00.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,三
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.17,0:20:08.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,现在我们达成协议
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.69,0:20:10.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一辈子都谨守秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.17,0:20:11.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 同意  - 同意
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.75,0:20:13.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 同意  - 同意
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.26,0:20:15.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,说啊 辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.39,0:20:17.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.23,0:20:19.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一辈子谨守秘密 说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.12,0:20:22.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一辈子都谨守秘密 说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.68,0:20:23.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,说啊 格瑞 冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.69,0:20:24.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一辈子谨守秘密格瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.73,0:20:29.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们绝口不提
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.90,0:20:32.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不提什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.82,0:20:34.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们刚杀了一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.24,0:20:37.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你刚刚就提了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.45,0:20:39.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,从现在开始算
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.12,0:20:41.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真是个蠢妞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.16,0:20:43.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我恨他
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.54,0:20:44.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不会有事的宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.61,0:20:46.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不会有事的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.22,0:20:47.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我保证 再摸一次
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.23,0:20:49.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.88,0:20:54.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你要向前看 辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.00,0:20:55.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一切都过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.98,0:20:57.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没错 这是巧合
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.69,0:20:58.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,格瑞说的对
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.97,0:21:01.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你以为我们在演恐怖片吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.23,0:21:05.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们说的对 如果是的话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.94,0:21:08.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,也许演我的人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.23,0:21:10.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,会是个大波霸
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.65,0:21:13.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,也许会找三十岁的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.08,0:21:14.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,老演员来演
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.45,0:21:19.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,摄影机准备 把我口香糖收好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.83,0:21:24.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,警长 请您讲几句话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.87,0:21:25.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,无可奉告
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.96,0:21:26.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.39,0:21:30.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我跟谁搞才弄得到内幕消息
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.50,0:21:32.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别乱跑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.38,0:21:36.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.76,0:21:38.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,慢慢走
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.55,0:21:39.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,咬我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.39,0:21:41.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.68,0:21:46.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是新闻前线采访记者 海盖儿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.73,0:21:48.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,特别警探阿呆
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.44,0:21:49.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你好 阿呆
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.52,0:21:52.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,阿呆 校园里出了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.40,0:21:53.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 无可奉告  - 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.33,0:21:54.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 无可奉告  - 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.49,0:21:58.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你真是个年轻有为的警探
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.82,0:22:00.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我二十五岁半了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.50,0:22:01.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就这么大
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.66,0:22:03.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真大
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.35,0:22:04.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对 很大了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.62,0:22:07.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你看来不过才十二岁
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.50,0:22:11.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但你的眼神可锐利了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.29,0:22:13.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那是口水吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.21,0:22:15.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对 我忘了吞下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.84,0:22:18.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不用担心 我不会忘的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.47,0:22:22.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,提醒我别再搔你了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.47,0:22:23.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.22,0:22:26.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,针对这场悲剧 警长和我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.97,0:22:29.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,会开始询问所有的学生
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.98,0:22:31.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看来似乎是有个
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.63,0:22:32.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,连续杀人犯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.11,0:22:34.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不能说
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.05,0:22:35.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是警方事务
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.77,0:22:38.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,阿呆 你和我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.05,0:22:39.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一起去车里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.36,0:22:41.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,互相认识一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.91,0:22:43.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.37,0:22:45.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 车里  - 对 就是那辆车
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.83,0:22:50.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.83,0:22:51.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.83,0:22:56.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这真是桩可怕的悲剧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.63,0:23:00.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,在这样的日子里 我们需要祷告
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.72,0:23:04.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,它已侵蚀我们的信念
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.39,0:23:07.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.18,0:23:09.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,去找你爸吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.19,0:23:15.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,下课后见
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.57,0:23:21.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好了 同学们 谁要先报告
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.07,0:23:24.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谁
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.00,0:23:27.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,还有谁
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.16,0:23:31.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 希瑟
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.67,0:23:37.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 可以开始了吗  - 可以
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.79,0:23:40.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要报告的是第一修正案
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.88,0:23:43.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是1787年5月25日
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.66,0:23:45.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,华盛顿在费城推动的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.72,0:23:47.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,记录上说
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.68,0:23:49.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的国父争论
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.47,0:23:51.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我国宪法的变迁
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.41,0:24:09.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(我知道去年万圣节的事)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.20,0:24:40.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(不对 我是指你们杀了人)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.68,0:24:44.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,第一修正案给我们言论自由
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.27,0:24:46.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,给我闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.61,0:24:50.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,下一个是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.66,0:24:52.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,坎 辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.79,0:24:56.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她是那个 谁的女儿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.50,0:25:01.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 对 就是她 性感的  - 性感的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.29,0:25:03.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对唯一的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.00,0:25:05.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,独一无二的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.13,0:25:09.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你好 辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.01,0:25:11.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,校长好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.43,0:25:12.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢了 阿呆
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.51,0:25:14.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我今天是特别警探阿呆
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.35,0:25:17.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,警长有些问题
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.84,0:25:19.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,想问你
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.85,0:25:22.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,什么鬼味道
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.10,0:25:23.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.73,0:25:24.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我大便了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.03,0:25:29.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是说 你拉在裤子上了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.36,0:25:30.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊 感觉很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.49,0:25:33.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 叫他出去  - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.72,0:25:37.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你阿呆  - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.29,0:25:40.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你该回特殊教育班上课了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.66,0:25:42.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好 敬礼
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.87,0:25:43.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,顺便换条内裤吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.92,0:25:46.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 拜 阿呆  - 拜 辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.71,0:25:50.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你好吗 辛蒂  - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.76,0:25:52.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你呢 警长
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.28,0:25:53.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,发福又便秘
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.76,0:25:56.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,屁股上还长了疮 跟以往一样
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.31,0:26:00.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,辛蒂 我想问你一些茱儿的事
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.52,0:26:02.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我跟她不熟
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.35,0:26:04.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托 你很熟的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.74,0:26:07.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不 我跟她真的不熟
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.07,0:26:09.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,少来了 别跟我打混
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.03,0:26:11.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谈谈茱儿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.38,0:26:14.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她在床上是什么样子
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.20,0:26:16.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,只是捉弄你一下
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.08,0:26:18.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,警察就喜欢这样
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.91,0:26:20.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,警察就喜欢这样
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.47,0:26:22.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你不会被骗 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.63,0:26:29.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,传球 传球
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.42,0:26:32.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好 洗澡了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.92,0:26:33.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.84,0:26:38.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,小杜 打的好 够赞!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.55,0:26:41.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,强森 阻挡得好
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.39,0:26:43.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,小伍 好屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.56,0:26:45.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.10,0:26:49.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,格瑞 你要去冲澡吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.61,0:26:53.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不 我要去打沙包 运动一下
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.44,0:26:56.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,随你便好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.41,0:26:58.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,最后冲澡的是大笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.95,0:27:01.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快啊 我要痛扁你们啰
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.04,0:27:04.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别让雷叔叔逮到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.81,0:27:26.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(我都知道)
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.27,0:27:32.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是谁干的 你在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.44,0:27:35.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这不好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.99,0:27:38.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,鸡鸡这么小可以算残障了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.11,0:27:42.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么可以欺负残障同胞
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.33,0:27:45.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,出来 你这个大变态
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.83,0:27:49.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要打的你满地找牙
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.04,0:27:51.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,大小不重要
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.83,0:27:53.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,重要的是好不好用
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.17,0:27:58.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她死了 真可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.01,0:28:00.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她是个好女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.51,0:28:03.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊 她照顾过我弟阿呆
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.51,0:28:04.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他爱死她了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.47,0:28:06.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,小雷 你死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.81,0:28:09.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.52,0:28:11.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,想光着身子摔角
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.40,0:28:12.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.06,0:28:15.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,帮我拿耳环 润滑剂呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.07,0:28:16.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别激动 怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.82,0:28:18.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我拿给你看
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.03,0:28:22.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是你
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.32,0:28:25.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那时候热水没了 我冲冷水
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.20,0:28:32.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,笑吧 笑大声点
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.83,0:28:35.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们都去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.50,0:28:39.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不是只有你这样
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.09,0:28:43.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么 巴比也一样小
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.05,0:28:47.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不 我是说收到警告
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.89,0:28:49.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我也收到了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.73,0:28:52.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有人知道
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.52,0:28:53.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.73,0:28:55.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有人想搞我们
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.77,0:28:57.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得报警
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.61,0:29:00.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你报警 我就宰了你
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.79,0:29:10.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你伤到她了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.54,0:29:12.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们最好都注意点
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.25,0:29:15.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那变态想杀我 那就来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.08,0:29:18.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我才不要去坐牢 懂吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.14,0:29:28.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,大家在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.22,0:29:31.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,算了 矮子 你知道太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.23,0:29:36.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(妙龄小姐选拔)
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.48,0:29:37.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们漂亮吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.11,0:29:40.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,棒透了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.44,0:29:41.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一号参赛者
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.20,0:29:47.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,很好 二号参赛者
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.66,0:29:55.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,很好 三号参赛者
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.79,0:29:58.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那是我马子
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.79,0:30:00.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那是我马子
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.54,0:30:02.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那也是我马子
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.42,0:30:05.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 去死吧  - 我也跟她搞过
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.63,0:30:06.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好耶 帕妃
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.26,0:30:08.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,闭上你的鸟嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.47,0:30:10.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她可火辣了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.30,0:30:12.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么想打架
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.85,0:30:14.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,现在进行才艺比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.81,0:30:16.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要去楼下看
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.51,0:30:16.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,待会儿见
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.02,0:30:20.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,三号参赛者 吉帕妃
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.19,0:30:23.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要上厕所
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.39,0:30:24.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,想喝什么吗
