Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.16,0:37:39.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.12,0:37:41.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.25,0:37:43.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉 警长
