Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.39,0:38:06.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没错 你看着
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.90,0:38:08.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 阿呆  - 埃
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.12,0:38:10.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 过来  - 好
