Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.98,0:39:34.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,警方有扣留任何人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.81,0:39:35.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,走吧 辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.98,0:39:37.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你屁股真肥
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.65,0:39:41.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,贱人
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.28,0:39:43.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,打的好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.41,0:39:44.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.07,0:39:46.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谁摸我
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.87,0:39:47.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.37,0:39:51.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我的天啊  - 这是意外
