Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.12,0:40:28.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.33,0:40:30.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.33,0:40:34.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,小杜 听电话
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.42,0:40:38.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 喂  - 干嘛
